	<section_number>6.2-1308</section_number>
	<catch_line>Supervision and regulation by Commission</catch_line>
	<text>
		Credit unions organized under the provisions of this chapter shall be subject to the supervision and regulation of the Commission.
	</text>
	<history>1990, c. 373, § 6.1-225.3; 2010, c. 794.</history>
</law>
